Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column|
		|testray.main.component.name|Mentions|

Set Up: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User add CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User edit Password CP
		|password|password|
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	Then User assign Regular Role CP
		|roleTitle|Administrator|
		|userScreenName|usersn|

Tear Down: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|

Scenario: View Mention Via DM Comment
Priority: 5
	Given Page add
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
	When Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Documents and Media|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMDocument add CP
		|dmDocumentDescription|DM Document Description|
		|dmDocumentFile|Document_1.txt|
		|dmDocumentSize|0KB|
		|dmDocumentTitle|DM Document Title|
	And User logout PG
	And User login User PG
		|password|test|
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
	And Click at locator 'Icon#DISPLAY_STYLE_DESCRIPTIVE'
	And DMDocument view PG
		|dmDocumentDescription|DM Document Description|
		|dmDocumentTitle|DM Document Title|
	And Mentions add Mention Via Comments
		|entryComment|Comment mentioning|
		|mentionsUserFullName|Test Test|
		|mentionsUserScreenName|test|
	Then Mentions view Comment Mention Tag Link
		|mentionsUserFullName|Test Test|
		|mentionsUserScreenName|test|

Scenario: View Reply Mention Via DM Comment
Priority: 5
	Given Page add
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
	When Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Documents and Media|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMDocument add CP
		|dmDocumentDescription|DM Document Description|
		|dmDocumentFile|Document_1.txt|
		|dmDocumentSize|0KB|
		|dmDocumentTitle|DM Document Title|
	And User logout PG
	And User login User PG
		|password|test|
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
	And Click at locator 'Icon#DISPLAY_STYLE_DESCRIPTIVE'
	And DMDocument view PG
		|dmDocumentDescription|DM Document Description|
		|dmDocumentTitle|DM Document Title|
	And Mentions add Mention Via Comments
		|entryComment|Comment mentioning|
		|mentionsUserFullName|Test Test|
		|mentionsUserScreenName|test|
	And Mentions view Comment Mention Tag Link
		|mentionsUserFullName|Test Test|
		|mentionsUserScreenName|test|
	And User logout PG
	And User login User PG
		|password|test|
		|userEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
	And Click at locator 'Icon#DISPLAY_STYLE_DESCRIPTIVE'
	And DMDocument view PG
		|dmDocumentDescription|DM Document Description|
		|dmDocumentTitle|DM Document Title|
	And these variables
		|key_entryComment|Comment mentioning|
	And AssertClick the value 'Reply' at locator 'Comments#REPLY_TO_COMMENT'
	And Mentions add Mention Via Comments
		|entryComment|Comment reply mentioning|
		|mentionsUserFullName|userfn userln|
		|mentionsUserScreenName|usersn|
	Then Mentions view Comment Mention Tag Link
		|mentionsUserFullName|userfn userln|
		|mentionsUserScreenName|usersn|